          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Therefore you shall love the LORD your God, and keep his instructions, his statutes, his ordinances, and his commandments, always.",
      "ko": "그런즉 네 하나님 여호와를 사랑하여 그 직임과 법도와 규례와 명령을 항상 지키라",
      "source_text_hash": "9e5711d8ae0f9cad6eba9bef12181014119e76030023a25851cef54414d84594",
      "translation_text_hash": "c1a3aeb5ec57426e79a5cfb9b39d1155ba340414415fc6ffcaa9ac2e6d0a5022",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그런즉 네 하나님 여호와를 사랑하여 그 직임과 법도와 규례와 명령을 항상 지키라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c1a3aeb5ec57426e79a5cfb9b39d1155ba340414415fc6ffcaa9ac2e6d0a5022"
